Z||000000||FieroLisa||04-06-2001||06:06 PM||||I did a search on this, but didn't really come up with a clear answer. I get so much brake dust on my rims, I'm looking for pads that specifically are made to make less dust. Any brands that you guys have had success with, and where to buy them? (Without paying an arm and a leg)<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 violet pearl 4 speed GT- 17 in. rims, lowered, cold-air,<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A><P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>Tarheels Fieros Website</A>||||reg||1
